{"text":"And then I got into Yale. This prestigious school where acting heavyweights like Meryl Streep and Angela Bassett honed their craft. Mind you at Yale, Meryl is so legendary that we just refer to her as the Streep. I was overjoyed. This was a gift I was given, an opportunity to immerse myself in my craft, surrounded by people of equal and greater talent. They had accepted me, and I had to prove to them and to myself that I deserved to be there. I couldn't afford to fail. I had traveled too far for that, and I had defied what was expected of me in my community. Too much was at stake. My dream was in motion, and it was very much in my own hands now. And I had every intention to work hard","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.74},{"text":"then","start":0.74,"end":1.02},{"text":"I","start":1.02,"end":1.28},{"text":"got","start":1.28,"end":1.54},{"text":"into","start":1.54,"end":1.98},{"text":"Yale","start":1.98,"end":2.28,"punct":"."},{"text":"This","start":3.38,"end":3.7},{"text":"prestigious","start":3.7,"end":4.16},{"text":"school","start":4.16,"end":4.74},{"text":"where","start":4.74,"end":5.04},{"text":"acting","start":5.04,"end":5.44},{"text":"heavyweights","start":5.44,"end":6.08},{"text":"like","start":6.08,"end":6.36},{"text":"Meryl","start":6.36,"end":6.68},{"text":"Streep","start":6.68,"end":7.12},{"text":"and","start":7.12,"end":7.28},{"text":"Angela","start":7.28,"end":7.66},{"text":"Bassett","start":7.66,"end":8.24},{"text":"honed","start":8.24,"end":8.64},{"text":"their","start":8.64,"end":8.84},{"text":"craft","start":8.84,"end":9.26,"punct":"."},{"text":"Mind","start":9.74,"end":9.82},{"text":"you","start":9.82,"end":9.98},{"text":"at","start":9.98,"end":10.1},{"text":"Yale","start":10.1,"end":10.4,"punct":","},{"text":"Meryl","start":10.6,"end":10.72},{"text":"is","start":10.72,"end":10.9},{"text":"so","start":10.9,"end":11.16},{"text":"legendary","start":11.16,"end":11.64},{"text":"that","start":11.64,"end":11.96},{"text":"we","start":11.